
### transfer funds through wallet microservice API
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id_from": "2",
    "account_id_to": "1",
    "amount": 10
}

### get update funds from balance microservice API
GET http://localhost:3003/balances/1
Content-Type: application/json

